Origin of the code
------------------
All source in this repository is original work, released under the MIT licence
in LICENSE. There are no vendored third-party sources: the simulator, the YAML
parser, the HTTP server, the SVG renderer and the diagrams are written from
scratch on the Python standard library.

Third-party content NOT included
--------------------------------
This project was written alongside a commercially published Kubernetes study
guide. No part of that guide is distributed here — no page images, no scanned
text, no PDF. `handbook/pages/` and `handbook/text/` ship empty and are listed
in .gitignore. If you own a copy of a study guide and want its pages shown
beside the exercises, `tools/import_handbook.py` extracts them on your own
machine, for your own use.

What is reproduced from the guide is factual and structural only: the ordering
of topics and which page number covers which topic. Facts and organising
schemes of that kind are not protected expression; the wording of every note,
gotcha, command explanation and diagram in this repository is this project's
own.

