Kubernetes API shapes
---------------------
The manifests use the field names and structure of the Kubernetes API. Those
are the public interface of an Apache-2.0 licensed project, and the manifests
here were written for these exercises rather than copied from the Kubernetes
documentation. Where an idea is a well-known Kubernetes idiom, it is described
in this project's own words.
